            "stringValue": "The incident involves an external caller executing a transaction targeting the submitted contract wallet on the Ethereum chain. This transaction contained specific input data that triggered an internal transfer of a substantial quantity of native assets from the contract to a third-party address. Because the contract was induced to transfer its native balance via an external call, this points to a protocol exploit or contract vulnerability where unauthorized access or logic flaws allowed the funds to be drained."
